Hanumān brings Sugrīva welfare and dharma counsel --- Hanumān tells Rāma exile and Sītā forest loss --- Hanumān tells Sugrīva pact Vālin death and worldwide search --- Hanumān names himself wind son who leapt ocean --- Hanumān warns no god can survive Rāma arrows --- Hanumān bids return Sītā as death night of Laṅkā --- Hanumān claims alone he could destroy Laṅkā --- Rāvaṇa rages and orders Hanumān killed